00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:22.120
*their* happy dances, dancing in front of *their* awesome places in *their* towns and neighborhoods,

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:27.500
and then we made a happy dance compilation video using all Nerdfighter happy dances!"

